WEBVTT

51:32.741 --> 51:33.742
(DOOR SLAMS)

51:33.867 --> 51:37.204
- Where is the beast?
- Chained up outside, Your Grace.

51:37.329 --> 51:39.289
Ser Ilyn, do me the honor.

51:39.414 --> 51:40.791
No.

51:41.833 --> 51:43.835
Jory...

51:45.295 --> 51:47.339
take the girls to their rooms.

51:51.635 --> 51:54.054
- (SANSA SOBBING)
- If it must be done,

51:54.179 --> 51:56.139
then I'll do it myself.

51:56.264 --> 51:58.308
Is this some trick?

51:58.433 --> 52:00.477
The wolf is of the North.
